# Apixaban + 10 MeOH QM molecular dynamics
# 10 explicit methanol molecules; short test trajectory for local solvent dynamics.
# 300 steps x 0.5 fs = 150 fs = 0.15 ps
#
# NOTE:
# The coordinate file must be prepared separately for the requested solvent.
# This input is a template for the corresponding XYZ.

! MD r2SCAN-3c TightSCF

%pal
  nprocs 4
end

%maxcore 1500

%md
  Timestep 0.5_fs
  Initvel 298.15_K
  Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
  Dump Position Stride 10 Filename "Apixaban_10MeOH_QMMD_300step_MD.xyz"
  Run 300
end

* xyzfile 0 1 Apixaban_10MeOH_QMMD_300step_initial.xyz
*
